WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.023
Start in Settings. Open the agency menu to confirm Brightwater

00:00:04.023 --> 00:00:08.045
Health Partners and Maya Chen’s account. This walkthrough uses fictional

00:00:08.045 --> 00:00:08.850
agency data.

00:00:09.583 --> 00:00:13.678
Open Products. Review the active products your agency sells and

00:00:13.678 --> 00:00:17.773
check their carrier selections against the business your team will

00:00:17.773 --> 00:00:18.183
write.

00:00:18.883 --> 00:00:22.733
Open the carrier selector to inspect the available carriers. Check

00:00:22.733 --> 00:00:26.583
that the selected carriers match the business your agency writes.

00:00:27.299 --> 00:00:32.449
Open Relationships. Review uplines, downlines, agents, and partnerships. Confirm the

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:37.599
agencies your team works with and check any pending invitations.

00:00:38.299 --> 00:00:41.957
Open Users to review teammates, roles, and account status. Use

00:00:41.957 --> 00:00:45.249
Add User when you are ready to invite someone.

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:50.700
Open Custom Fields. Review the existing sections and field types

00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:55.100
before deciding which additional information your team needs to collect.

00:00:55.800 --> 00:01:00.161
In Marketplace, open Manage Access on a queue. Review each

00:01:00.161 --> 00:01:03.650
agent’s eligibility and intended access before making assignments.

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:08.944
Finally, review Wallet to check the balance, saved payment methods,

00:01:08.944 --> 00:01:13.087
and auto-recharge settings. Marketplace agencies use Wallet in place of

00:01:13.087 --> 00:01:13.501
Billing.
